# The image compiles in its builder stage, so its context is source and the
# two files that pin the toolchain. Everything else -- `.venv` above all --
# stays out of the context and out of every layer.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
# The corpus. data/sample.sql and data/sample-theme-map.md are committed;
# data/notes.sqlite and data/theme-map.md are gitignored and ride in from
# the WORKING DIRECTORY, which is what a build context is. An image built
# with them present holds unpublished material -- the whole database, not
# only the columns the app shows: keep it in a private registry.
!data/
